      <a href="#" onclick="event.preventDefault();openAdminRecovery();" style="font-size:12px;color:var(--gold);font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer;">🔑 Nimesahau nywila ya admin?</a>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top:12px;font-size:11px;color:var(--gray-400);line-height:1.6;">
      💡 Mkato wa kibodi: <kbd style="background:var(--gray-100);padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-size:11px;">Ctrl + Shift + A</kbd>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

