    </div>
    <div style="margin-top:14px;padding:10px;background:var(--gray-100);border-radius:8px;font-size:11px;color:var(--gray-600);line-height:1.6;text-align:left;">
      ℹ️ Recovery code ilitolewa ulipo-setup mara ya kwanza au ulipoibadilisha kwenye Setup tab.
      Kama hujawahi kuihifadhi, weka recovery code <b>LETEMA-RESET-DEFAULT</b> kurudi kwenye nywila ya kawaida (<i>Letema123@</i>).
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

