  {id:'s4',  name:'Graphics Design',                price:'TZS 10,000+',        icon:'🎨', category:'kitaalamu', fileUpload:true, desc:'Usanifu wa kitaalamu wa logo, lebo za bidhaa, poster za matangazo, kadi za biashara, mabango, social media graphics, letterheads na vifaa vyote vya branding ya kampuni yako.', gold:true,
